    <StreamGeometry x:Key="GeoPlus">F0 M10.75,3.4 H13.25 V10.75 H20.6 V13.25 H13.25 V20.6 H10.75 V13.25 H3.4 V10.75 H10.75 Z</StreamGeometry>

