    <StreamGeometry x:Key="GeoUnlock">F0 M4.8,11.6 H19.2 A1.8,1.8 0 0 1 21,13.4 V18.8 A1.8,1.8 0 0 1 19.2,20.6 H4.8 A1.8,1.8 0 0 1 3,18.8 V13.4 A1.8,1.8 0 0 1 4.8,11.6 Z M7.9,11.6 V7.4 A4.4,4.4 0 0 1 16.3,5.9 L14.2,7.2 A1.9,1.9 0 0 0 10.3,7.9 V11.6 Z M12,14.3 A1.6,1.6 0 1 0 12,17.5 A1.6,1.6 0 1 0 12,14.3 Z M11.15,17.4 H12.85 L13.15,19.8 H10.85 Z</StreamGeometry>

